    "txt-contact-206": "⚠️ If you are in a life-threatening emergency, don't wait. Call <strong>15</strong> (SAMU), <strong>3114</strong> (suicide), <strong>3919</strong> (violence) or <strong>115</strong> (accommodation).",
    "txt-contact-207": "<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px; background:var(--light); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);\">\n<span data-i18n=\"txt-contact-186\">🏥 SAMU — medical emergency</span><strong>15</strong>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px; background:var(--light); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);\">\n<span data-i18n=\"txt-contact-187\">💙 Suicide prevention</span><strong>3114</strong>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px; background:var(--light); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);\">\n<span data-i18n=\"txt-contact-188\">🟣 Domestic violence</span><strong>3919</strong>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px; background:var(--light); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);\">\n<span data-i18n=\"txt-contact-189\">🏠 Emergency Accommodation</span><strong>115</strong>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px; background:var(--light); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);\">\n<span data-i18n=\"txt-contact-190\">🧒 Child in danger</span><strong>119</strong>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px; background:var(--light); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);\">\n<span data-i18n=\"txt-contact-191\">🚒 Firefighters</span><strong>18</strong>\n</div>",
