    "txt-humanitaire-263": "Benevolent AI support for people in vulnerable situations — employment, housing, rights, health, training and social orientation.",
    "txt-humanitaire-264": "This platform welcomes all situations of vulnerability or transition, without conditions or judgment.",
    "txt-humanitaire-265": "People looking for a long time, without a network, with an obsolete CV or a gap in their career path.",
    "txt-humanitaire-266": "People who have recently arrived, in the process of regularization, without health coverage or stable housing.",
    "txt-humanitaire-267": "Homeless, in precarious accommodation or facing eviction proceedings.",
    "txt-humanitaire-268": "After dismissal, burn-out or voluntary reorientation, without resources for training.",
    "txt-humanitaire-269": "Students or young adults without stable housing, income or family support.",
    "txt-humanitaire-270": "People emerging from a situation of violence, seeking security, employment and reconstruction.",
    "txt-humanitaire-271": "Each situation automatically activates the necessary agents. Everyone works together.",
    "txt-humanitaire-272": "Coordinates everything, prioritizes urgent needs, activates the right agents and produces the overall action plan.",
    "txt-humanitaire-273": "Understands the real situation, detects implicit needs and distress signals.",
    "txt-humanitaire-274": "Explains rights, procedures and writes letters and letters — without replacing a lawyer.",
    "txt-humanitaire-275": "Writes the CV, personalizes the cover letter, prepares for interviews according to the targeted sector.",
    "txt-humanitaire-276": "Identifies training, explains CPF, OPCO, Pro-A and builds a realistic retraining plan.",
    "txt-humanitaire-277": "Refers to associations, social services, food aid and structures depending on the geographical location.",
    "txt-humanitaire-278": "DALO, FSL, 115, CHRS — supports emergency or maintenance housing procedures.",
    "txt-humanitaire-279": "AME, CSS, PASS — explains health rights and provides guidance without making a diagnosis.",
    "txt-humanitaire-280": "Caring listening, reformulation, identification of internal resources and referrals to help lines.",
    "txt-humanitaire-281": "Adapts communication in 10 languages ​​and simplifies if necessary (FALC, clear language).",
    "txt-humanitaire-282": "Create a plan in 3 horizons: today / 30 days / medium term, with concrete steps.",
    "txt-humanitaire-283": "Checks consistency, indicates confidence level, and flags what requires a human professional.",
    "txt-humanitaire-284": "Concrete documents, directly usable, adapted to each situation.",
    "txt-humanitaire-285": "Adapted to the sector, promoting real skills.",
    "txt-humanitaire-286": "Personalized, sincere, adapted to the situation.",
    "txt-humanitaire-287": "CAF, prefecture, town hall, social housing, landlord.",
    "txt-humanitaire-288": "Prioritized over 3 horizons with contacts and deadlines.",
    "txt-humanitaire-289": "Adapted training, funding available.",
    "txt-humanitaire-290": "Associations, organizations, services by situation.",
    "txt-humanitaire-291": "Questions/answers, posture, presentation.",
    "txt-humanitaire-292": "AME, CSS, PASS — coverage and access to care.",
    "txt-humanitaire-293": "Each support follows a caring and comprehensive structure.",
    "txt-humanitaire-294": "Benevolent reformulation of the real situation",
    "txt-humanitaire-295": "Urgent · Important · To anticipate",
    "txt-humanitaire-296": "List of agents mobilized for the situation",
    "txt-humanitaire-297": "Analysis and structured response by domain",
    "txt-humanitaire-298": "Adapted organizations, numbers, associations",
    "txt-humanitaire-299": "Today · 30 days · Medium term",
    "txt-humanitaire-300": "No judgment. The situation is reformulated with respect and without negative interpretation.",
    "txt-humanitaire-301": "Language adapted to the level of understanding. FALC available. 10 languages ​​supported.",
    "txt-humanitaire-302": "What the platform can do and what requires a human professional are always distinguished.",
    "txt-humanitaire-303": "If a crisis signal is detected, emergency numbers are provided immediately.",
    "txt-humanitaire-304": "The goal is to help the person understand and act, not to decide for them.",
    "txt-humanitaire-305": "The national structures that the platform can mobilize to guide you.",
    "txt-humanitaire-306": "The platform is available for any situation, without judgment and without conditions. Start by describing your situation.",
