    "txt-plateforme-399": "20 main agents, 36 sub-agents, 8 connected tools — a modular platform to analyze, correct, structure and deliver.",
    "txt-plateforme-400": "Each tool plays a specific role. <strong>AND</strong> logic: use both when they are complementary.",
    "txt-plateforme-401": "The orchestrator selects and sequences the others on each request.",
    "txt-plateforme-402": "Controls everything, selects the agents, merges the results and produces the final response.",
    "txt-plateforme-403": "Classifies the content submitted: CV, contract, report, invoice, code, image, table.",
    "txt-plateforme-404": "Spelling, grammar, conjugation, punctuation, style and clarity.",
    "txt-plateforme-405": "Transforms the analysis into an executive summary + recommendations + action plan.",
    "txt-plateforme-406": "Detects contradictions, checks consistency and assigns a confidence level.",
    "txt-plateforme-407": "Transforms a vague request into a precise operational prompt.",
    "txt-plateforme-408": "Detects existing and missing skills, generates the necessary ones.",
    "txt-plateforme-409": "Transforms the idea into a roadmap with MVP, steps and success criteria.",
    "txt-plateforme-410": "Designs the user journey and interface structure.",
    "txt-plateforme-411": "Detects sensitive data, secures access and API keys.",
    "txt-plateforme-412": "Verifies consent, retention, deletion and compliance.",
    "txt-plateforme-413": "Analyzes CVs, applications, prepares the interview and adapts the speech.",
    "txt-plateforme-414": "Tone and style analysis without diagnosis — limited to observable textual cues.",
    "txt-plateforme-415": "Anticipates developments, risks and opportunities with a level of confidence.",
    "txt-plateforme-416": "Verifies institutional sources, separates fact from hypothesis.",
    "txt-plateforme-417": "Search for known patents, analyze proximity to the idea, report risks.",
    "txt-plateforme-418": "Transforms the solution into a salable offer with an argument and conversion tunnel.",
    "txt-plateforme-419": "Models the project tables, relationships and histories.",
    "txt-plateforme-420": "Connect tools, define workflows and automate exports.",
    "txt-plateforme-421": "Produces user and technical documentation and user guides.",
    "txt-plateforme-422": "Supabase — PostgreSQL with authentication, file and vector storage for RAG memory.",
    "txt-plateforme-423": "6 progressive phases — from proof of concept to full SaaS platform.",
    "txt-plateforme-424": "Orchestrator, file detection, language correction, automatic reporting, quality control.",
    "txt-plateforme-425": "Technical, legal, financial, marketing, HR, sales, security.",
    "txt-plateforme-426": "n8n + Supabase connection, forms, storage and multi-format exports.",
    "txt-plateforme-427": "Official sources, competitive intelligence, patent searches, citations.",
    "txt-plateforme-428": "User interface, accounts, free/paid offers, documentation, support.",
    "txt-plateforme-429": "CrewAI crews, LangGraph state machines, memory, control loops and observability.",
    "txt-plateforme-430": "Start with the free stack. Claude Free + NotebookLM + Supabase Free is enough for the prototype.",
